# examples/spinalhdl-ported/fifo/tb_fifo_stream_example.verif
#
# **Stream FIFO 示例的验证源**（ADR-074 D1 · ADR-076 · 单一语义来源）
#
# 被测语义（**spec-derived** = 上游 `samples/fifo_example.cpp` 的经典方案）：
#   · 深度 16（addr_width = 4）· 同步读写 · `dout` = `aread(rd)` ⇒ **0 拍组合读**（FWFT）
#   · `empty` = 读指针 == 写指针（全部位）· `full` = 地址位相等 + wrap 位不同
#   ⇒ ⇒ **D5 回归**：在途 15 ⇒ full=0；在途 16 ⇒ full=1（旧公式门限 31 ⇒ 必红）
#
# ⚠️ **`dout` 是组合读**（`aread`）⇒ `SET`/`TICK` 之后 MUST `SETTLE` 再 `EXPECT`。
#
# 原语封闭集：SET / TICK / SETTLE / WAIT / EXPECT / EXPECT_STABLE / OBSERVE / RESET
#             + RECORD / EXPECT_SEQ_SELF / EXPECT_SEQ_STEP / EXPECT_SEQ_COUNT（ADR-076）
#
@expect-src .rddf/checks/examples-rtl-expectations.md#fifo-stream-example
@tb-module tb_fifo_stream_example

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 1：复位后为空（impl-contract）
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario reset_empty
@anchor fifo-stream-example

SET push 0
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT empty 1
EXPECT full 0

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 2：**顺序保持**（spec-derived）—— 入队 3 个 ⇒ 出队顺序完全相同
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario order_preserved
@anchor fifo-stream-example

SET din 0x11
SET push 1
TICK 1
SET din 0x22
TICK 1
SET din 0x33
TICK 1
SET push 0
SETTLE
EXPECT empty 0
EXPECT dout 0x11

SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT dout 0x22

SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT dout 0x33

SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT empty 1
EXPECT full 0

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 3（**metamorphic**）：5 个元素的**序列恒等**
#   · 入队 5 个 ⇒ 出队逐个等于入队序列（不依赖任何内部指针值）
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario sequence_identity
@anchor fifo-stream-example

SET din 0xA1
SET push 1
TICK 1
SET din 0xB2
TICK 1
SET din 0xC3
TICK 1
SET din 0xD4
TICK 1
SET din 0xE5
TICK 1
SET push 0
SETTLE

EXPECT dout 0xA1
SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT dout 0xB2
SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT dout 0xC3
SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT dout 0xD4
SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT dout 0xE5
SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT empty 1

# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 场景 4：**容量边界 = 16**（spec-derived · D5 回归）
#   · 在途 15 ⇒ full=0 · 在途 16 ⇒ full=1 · 取回 16 ⇒ empty=1
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@scenario capacity_16
@anchor fifo-stream-example

SET din 0x5A
SET push 1
TICK 15
SET push 0
SETTLE
EXPECT full 0

SET push 1
TICK 1
SET push 0
SETTLE
EXPECT full 1
EXPECT empty 0

SET pop 1
TICK 15
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT empty 0
EXPECT dout 0x5A

SET pop 1
TICK 1
SET pop 0
SETTLE
EXPECT empty 1
